  "title": "StepStone Group to Present at the Morgan Stanley US Financials Conference",
  "summary": "StepStone Group Inc. (Nasdaq: STEP) today announced that Scott Hart, CEO, and Mike McCabe, Head of Strategy, are scheduled to present at the Morgan Stanley US Financials Conference on Tuesday, June 9, 2026, at 11:15 am ET. A live webcast and replay will be accessible through the StepStone website at https://shareholders.stepstonegroup.com. About StepStone StepStone Group […]The post StepStone Group to Present at the Morgan Stanley US Financials Conference appeared first on StepStone Group .",
